{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Dead man's switch"},"description":"Dead-man switch for a person or a long job: unless someone checks in every interval_seconds (60+, default\none day) plus grace, on_miss runs once (same shapes as heartbeat). create returns write_token, checkin_token\nand checkin_url, a page where a person checks in with a button; give them that link. Pass write_token as\n`token` (checkin_token works for checkin and read). read(status, wait_seconds) waits for a change. After a\nmiss only rearm restarts it.","inputSchema":{"properties":{"action":{"enum":["create","read","checkin","disarm","rearm","touch","delete"],"title":"Action","type":"string"},"grace_seconds":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":86400,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Grace Seconds"},"id":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,64}$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Id"},"interval_seconds":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":604800,"minimum":60,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Interval Seconds"},"message":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":500,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Message"},"on_miss":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":true,"type":"object"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"On Miss"},"status":{"anyOf":[{"enum":["armed","missed","disarmed"],"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Status"},"token":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":128,"minLength":16,"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Token"},"ttl_seconds":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":604800,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Ttl Seconds"},"wait_seconds":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":30,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}],"default":null,"title":"Wait Seconds"}},"required":["action"],"title":"deadmanArguments","type":"object"},"name":"deadman","title":"Dead man's switch"}
